Transparency & Disclosure
Scope & Core Inquiries: Across all research categories, how easy was it to find verifiable data for this business? Does the company proactively make its own comprehensive, audited disclosures—such as detailed ESG reports, country-by-country tax reporting, full supply chain lists, and EEO-1 workforce data—or does it rely on opaque corporate structures, private status, and boilerplate filings? Does it make it easy for journalists, researchers, and watchdog organizations to find out what they need to know, or does it stonewall inquiries, enforce sweeping non-disclosure agreements (NDAs) and gag orders, and hide behind excessive trade-secret claims? Is there a suspicious lack of information or conspicuous absence of reporting present for any of these topics?